        "detailed_description": "<strong>Command. Conquer. Dominate.</strong><br>In Empire’s Supreme Command, every move counts.<br>This is a deep turn-based strategy and empire-building game where your tactical decisions shape the fate of your nation.<br><br>Plan your path to victory through diplomacy, technology, espionage, and warfare.<br>Whether you prefer forging alliances or leading full-scale invasions, your choices will decide the future of your empire.<br><br><strong>Key Features</strong> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991280/extras/ce2c94957635a37e7fe14ecfac968944.avif?t=1760280983\" width=100 height=100 /></span> <br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic Turn-Based Gameplay</strong></p>Take your time to plan each move. Outsmart AI or other players in epic land and naval battles.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991280/extras/c92ccea19f635799654154f0b1b034f8.avif?t=1760280983\" width=100 height=100 /></span><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Empire Building &amp; Resource Management</strong></p>Conquer cities, expand your territory, control valuable resources, and grow a powerful economy to fuel your campaigns.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991280/extras/107ec84eb62d42252a71eba388551c2f.avif?t=1760280983\" width=100 height=100 /></span><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep Diplomacy System</strong></p>Negotiate alliances, broker peace, trade resources, or launch surprise attacks. Balance trust and betrayal to your advantage.  <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991280/extras/7dedfa40b9c66f09673059655d94d137.avif?t=1760280983\" width=100 height=100 /></span><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Advanced Warfare</strong></p>Deploy generals, admirals, artillery, tanks, aircraft, and naval fleets. Use terrain, technology, and positioning to outmaneuver your enemies. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991280/extras/ff7f50e38d0f454912ad473085c7ff0c.avif?t=1760280983\" width=100 height=100 /></span><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Technology &amp; Espionage</strong></p>Research military upgrades, extend artillery and battleship range, unlock satellites, and send spies to uncover enemy plans.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991280/extras/32acd88bb0518fd7c4c9d8ef467350fc.avif?t=1760280983\" width=100 height=100 /></span><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tactical Terrain Control</strong></p>Fortify tiles, place mines, secure borders, and plan strategic strikes to protect your empire and weaken your rivals.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991280/extras/7121531104fcd9d4d48573e9b8be9971.avif?t=1760280983\" width=100 height=100 /></span><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Difficulty Levels</strong></p>Challenge yourself against adaptive AI opponents that respond to your strategies.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991280/extras/f75591040bbea30aefe6c95c4f612cdb.avif?t=1760280983\" width=100 height=100 /></span><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Replayability</strong></p>Every game is different. Experiment with new tactics, explore different maps, and try unique victory paths.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991280/extras/a84291567e32b9ccbb2a0b3f21f08609.avif?t=1760280983\" width=100 height=100 /></span><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From your first conquered tile to your final decisive victory, Empire’s Supreme Command offers an immersive blend of 4X strategy (Explore, Expand, Exploit, Exterminate), tactical combat, and empire management. </p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Are you ready to lead, Supreme Commander?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Start building your empire today.</strong></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<strong>Command. Conquer. Dominate.</strong><br>In Empire’s Supreme Command, every move counts.<br>This is a deep turn-based strategy and empire-building game where your tactical decisions shape the fate of your nation.<br><br>Plan your path to victory through diplomacy, technology, espionage, and warfare.<br>Whether you prefer forging alliances or leading full-scale invasions, your choices will decide the future of your empire.<br><br><strong>Key Features</strong> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991280/extras/ce2c94957635a37e7fe14ecfac968944.avif?t=1760280983\" width=100 height=100 /></span> <br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategic Turn-Based Gameplay</strong></p>Take your time to plan each move. Outsmart AI or other players in epic land and naval battles.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991280/extras/c92ccea19f635799654154f0b1b034f8.avif?t=1760280983\" width=100 height=100 /></span><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Empire Building &amp; Resource Management</strong></p>Conquer cities, expand your territory, control valuable resources, and grow a powerful economy to fuel your campaigns.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991280/extras/107ec84eb62d42252a71eba388551c2f.avif?t=1760280983\" width=100 height=100 /></span><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep Diplomacy System</strong></p>Negotiate alliances, broker peace, trade resources, or launch surprise attacks. Balance trust and betrayal to your advantage.  <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991280/extras/7dedfa40b9c66f09673059655d94d137.avif?t=1760280983\" width=100 height=100 /></span><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Advanced Warfare</strong></p>Deploy generals, admirals, artillery, tanks, aircraft, and naval fleets. Use terrain, technology, and positioning to outmaneuver your enemies. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991280/extras/ff7f50e38d0f454912ad473085c7ff0c.avif?t=1760280983\" width=100 height=100 /></span><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Technology &amp; Espionage</strong></p>Research military upgrades, extend artillery and battleship range, unlock satellites, and send spies to uncover enemy plans.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991280/extras/32acd88bb0518fd7c4c9d8ef467350fc.avif?t=1760280983\" width=100 height=100 /></span><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tactical Terrain Control</strong></p>Fortify tiles, place mines, secure borders, and plan strategic strikes to protect your empire and weaken your rivals.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991280/extras/7121531104fcd9d4d48573e9b8be9971.avif?t=1760280983\" width=100 height=100 /></span><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Difficulty Levels</strong></p>Challenge yourself against adaptive AI opponents that respond to your strategies.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991280/extras/f75591040bbea30aefe6c95c4f612cdb.avif?t=1760280983\" width=100 height=100 /></span><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Replayability</strong></p>Every game is different. Experiment with new tactics, explore different maps, and try unique victory paths.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3991280/extras/a84291567e32b9ccbb2a0b3f21f08609.avif?t=1760280983\" width=100 height=100 /></span><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From your first conquered tile to your final decisive victory, Empire’s Supreme Command offers an immersive blend of 4X strategy (Explore, Expand, Exploit, Exterminate), tactical combat, and empire management. </p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Are you ready to lead, Supreme Commander?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Start building your empire today.</strong></p>",
